<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 962 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 962 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT said its Project A overnight agricultural contracts trading volume totaled 962 contracts.CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 18 wheat, 368 corn, 557 soybean, 12 soymeal plus one corn call and 28 soybean call options.</p>
<p>The overnight trend for corn was 3/4 to 1-3/4 cents lower, soybeans 3-1/2 to four cents lower, soyoil 0.15 to 0.18 cent per lb lower and soymeal $0.60 to $1.00 per ton lower.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
